How did you get along with Tang Xin?

296
00:15:49,919 --> 00:15:50,679
Very well.

297
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,320
We had a good time.

298
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,519
Her pipa playing

299
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:57,480
is the best I've heard

300
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:58,799
in my years in the music house.

301
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:00,720
With her on board,

302
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:02,039
the final trial

303
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:03,440
will be a breeze.

304
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:04,879
You've already picked a piece?

305
00:16:05,679 --> 00:16:06,399
Not yet.

306
00:16:06,879 --> 00:16:09,120
But once I finish the lyrics,

307
00:16:09,159 --> 00:16:10,720
the melody will naturally follow.

308
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:12,440
Good.

309
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,320
Once our agreement ends,

310
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:15,840
I won't stand in your way.

311
00:16:17,279 --> 00:16:19,399
Since Tang Xin has agreed to compose for you,

312
00:16:19,399 --> 00:16:20,440
you should treat her well.

313
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:22,559
Give her some jewelry,

314
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:23,559
or cosmetics.

315
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,039
They'll be useful at the Starry Sky Assembly.

316
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:25,600
Wait.

317
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:28,799
First, I don't understand.

318
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:30,200
Second,

319
00:16:30,919 --> 00:16:31,919
it's not necessary.

320
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,120
Of course it is.

321
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,320
You'll thank me

322
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:35,360
when you understand.

323
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:47,679
Yicheng,

324
00:16:48,399 --> 00:16:50,000
what does she mean?

325
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:52,080
What do you mean?

326
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:56,120
She asked me to buy rouge for Tang Xin,

327
00:16:56,399 --> 00:16:58,440
and said the alliance would not

328
00:16:58,799 --> 00:16:59,519
when the agreement expires.

329
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,840
Who? Who's with me?

330
00:17:03,799 --> 00:17:04,279
My Lord.

331
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:06,839
It's not me.

332
00:17:07,319 --> 00:17:08,279
You go to Huayue Tower first.

333
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:09,319
I'll pick you up later.

334
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:18,359
A younger brother cannot be kept at home.

335
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,319
Why hasn't Cheng Qi come yet?

336
00:17:43,039 --> 00:17:44,000
It's been so long.

337
00:17:44,119 --> 00:17:45,079
He should have bought it by now.

338
00:17:47,559 --> 00:17:48,160
Stop eating seeds.

339
00:17:48,799 --> 00:17:50,599
You always eat seeds here.

340
00:18:00,079 --> 00:18:02,359
But you're so mysterious today.

341
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,599
What do you want to do?

342
00:18:06,799 --> 00:18:07,279
Xin,

343
00:18:07,559 --> 00:18:08,160
you know that

344
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:11,039
I married Cheng Qi for the Escort Agency.

345
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,640
After I take over,

346
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,039
I will divorce him.

347
00:18:14,680 --> 00:18:16,319
Here is the divorce paper.

348
00:18:16,599 --> 00:18:17,000
Here you are.

349
00:18:18,359 --> 00:18:19,519
Why do you give it to me?

350
00:18:21,519 --> 00:18:22,480
I know

351
00:18:22,799 --> 00:18:24,519
you and Cheng Qi are the same kind of person.

352
00:18:25,119 --> 00:18:27,480
You write lyrics and he writes music.

353
00:18:28,079 --> 00:18:29,359
Aren't you

354
00:18:29,759 --> 00:18:31,160
Bo Ya and his wife?

355
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:38,880
It's Yu Boya and Zhong Ziqi.

356
00:18:39,160 --> 00:18:39,559
Right, right.

357
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:40,480
They are a couple.

358
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,680
So don't worry.

359
00:18:44,079 --> 00:18:45,559
If you two are in love,

360
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:46,680
I won't stop you.

361
00:18:47,400 --> 00:18:49,039
But for now,

362
00:18:49,039 --> 00:18:49,960
you have to keep it a secret for me.

363
00:18:58,200 --> 00:18:58,720
Tell me.

364
00:18:59,119 --> 00:19:00,519
Did your brother say something to you?

365
00:19:01,839 --> 00:19:03,000
If he hadn't reminded me,

366
00:19:03,359 --> 00:19:04,240
I wouldn't have realized

367
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:05,319
how well

368
00:19:05,599 --> 00:19:06,920
you two match.

369
00:19:08,400 --> 00:19:09,480
I knew it.

370
00:19:09,759 --> 00:19:10,880
It must be Su Yeqi,

371
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,599
that inarticulate block of wood,

372
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:14,960
who led you, another block of wood, astray.

373
00:19:31,559 --> 00:19:33,680
He saw me drinking with Cheng Qi last time,

374
00:19:34,759 --> 00:19:36,160
and ran away after leaving this.

375
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:39,960
Jiaojiao,

376
00:19:40,599 --> 00:19:42,799
I do have someone I like,

377
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:44,319
but it's not Cheng Qi.

378
00:19:48,039 --> 00:19:49,000
It's your brother.

379
00:19:55,839 --> 00:19:56,960
Does my brother know it?

380
00:19:59,640 --> 00:20:00,680
You are really brother and sister.

381
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:02,279
If he knows,

382
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:04,079
he won't misunderstand me and Cheng Qi.

383
00:20:04,279 --> 00:20:06,400
You just want to match us up.

384
00:20:06,519 --> 00:20:07,480
It's because

385
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:10,279
you can't see Cheng Qi's concern about you.

386
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:20,000
Take it away.

387
00:20:30,359 --> 00:20:31,000
Sir.

388
00:20:31,279 --> 00:20:31,799
Sir.

389
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,400
Let's talk.

390
00:20:33,599 --> 00:20:34,519
I'm just a scholar.

391
00:20:34,519 --> 00:20:35,240
I don't have much money.

392
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:36,839
Why do you want to tie me up?

393
00:20:41,279 --> 00:20:43,200
Do you know Su Yujiao from Su's Escort Agency?

394
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:44,359
She's my wife.

395
00:20:44,759 --> 00:20:45,759
You can't beat her.

396
00:20:46,200 --> 00:20:47,039
Let me go now.

397
00:20:47,240 --> 00:20:47,839
Otherwise,

398
00:20:47,839 --> 00:20:48,839
she won't let you go.

399
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:53,359
It's you.

400
00:21:00,799 --> 00:21:01,519
Brother Bai.

401
00:21:01,799 --> 00:21:02,960
Why did you tie me up?

402
00:21:03,119 --> 00:21:05,000
Is there any misunderstanding between us?

403
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:07,119
You shouldn't be in the Escort Agency.

404
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:09,319
I'm the son-in-law of the Agency.

405
00:21:09,720 --> 00:21:10,599
I shouldn't be in the Agency?

406
00:21:10,599 --> 00:21:11,640
Where should I be?

407
00:21:13,039 --> 00:21:14,720
If you admit you like someone else,

408
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:16,279
and leave Su Yuejiao,

409
00:21:16,720 --> 00:21:17,599
I'll let you go.

410
00:21:18,759 --> 00:21:20,680
It seems that it's really Su Li's order.

411
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:22,599
I only love my wife.

412
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,319
It's impossible to separate us.

413
00:21:25,759 --> 00:21:27,559
Beat him until he tells the truth.

414
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:31,319
Don't run.

415
00:21:31,519 --> 00:21:32,319
Stop.

416
00:21:32,839 --> 00:21:33,440
Stop.

417
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:34,680
Don't run.

418
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:36,920
Why can he run so fast?

419
00:21:37,319 --> 00:21:38,640
Stop running.

420
00:21:40,519 --> 00:21:41,200
Where is he?

421
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:43,200
Stop.

422
00:21:44,279 --> 00:21:44,720
You're really fast!

423
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:44,920
Stop!

424
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:46,039
Stop chasing!

425
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:47,119
Stop!

426
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:50,119
You're really fast!

427
00:21:50,279 --> 00:21:51,319
You're so fast!

428
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:56,880
Tell me,

429
00:21:57,319 --> 00:21:58,240
will you divorce or not?

430
00:21:58,240 --> 00:21:58,920
No!

431
00:21:59,519 --> 00:22:00,440
Still talking back?

432
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:01,799
Stop!

433
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:07,839
Bai Yanli,

434
00:22:08,240 --> 00:22:09,559
what grudges do you have with him?

435
00:22:09,720 --> 00:22:11,079
You tried to hurt him several times.

436
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:12,359
He doesn't like you at all,

437
00:22:12,599 --> 00:22:13,440
and he's your sister's...

438
00:22:13,440 --> 00:22:14,880
It's not what you think.

439
00:22:15,880 --> 00:22:17,640
Why don't I kill this unfaithful man for you?

440
00:22:17,960 --> 00:22:19,279
You don't listen to me, right?

441
00:22:21,400 --> 00:22:22,440
Then beat me first.

442
00:22:27,880 --> 00:22:28,359
Cheng Yicheng,

443
00:22:28,640 --> 00:22:29,160
help him out.

444
00:22:29,359 --> 00:22:29,640
Okay.

445
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:42,680
I won't hurt you.

446
00:22:43,799 --> 00:22:44,720
When we get back to the agency,

447
00:22:44,920 --> 00:22:45,680
you better explain everything to me.

448
00:22:57,759 --> 00:22:59,079
My lady, what are you doing here?

449
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:00,119
Are you alright?

450
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:02,359
I'm fine.

451
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:04,440
Compared to my father's fists,

452
00:23:04,720 --> 00:23:05,359
this was nothing.

453
00:23:06,759 --> 00:23:07,599
I'm sorry you had to suffer.

454
00:23:09,720 --> 00:23:10,559
I made you some medicine.

455
00:23:10,640 --> 00:23:11,240
Drink it while it's hot.

456
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:14,920
You should teach that Bai Yanli a lesson.

457
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:16,039
He's so annoying.

458
00:23:16,240 --> 00:23:17,880
I'm still scared when I think about it.

459
00:23:17,880 --> 00:23:18,640
If it weren't for you,

460
00:23:18,640 --> 00:23:19,440
I wouldn't have been able to come back.

461
00:23:20,480 --> 00:23:22,000
If you hadn't dropped this

462
00:23:22,400 --> 00:23:23,400
at the entrance of Huayue Tower,

463
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:25,319
I wouldn't have known you were in trouble.

464
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:26,400
Drink it.

465
00:23:27,799 --> 00:23:28,319
My lady,

466
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:30,720
my relationship with Tang Xin

467
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:31,839
is just a partnership.

468
00:23:32,079 --> 00:23:33,440
There's nothing improper between us.

469
00:23:33,799 --> 00:23:34,599
I know.

470
00:23:34,920 --> 00:23:35,759
Because Tang Xin

471
00:23:35,759 --> 00:23:36,960
likes your brother.

472
00:23:37,960 --> 00:23:38,640
How do you know?

473
00:23:38,799 --> 00:23:41,559
And I also know your brother likes Tang Xin.

474
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:44,480
In his eyes,

475
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:46,799
I took away his two favorite women.

476
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:48,960
At the beginning of the kidnapping,

477
00:23:48,960 --> 00:23:49,920
I thought it was your brother.

478
00:23:50,359 --> 00:23:52,200
Who knows it's Bai Yanliang.

479
00:23:53,359 --> 00:23:54,799
My brother doesn't want to kidnap you.

480
00:23:55,039 --> 00:23:57,119
He wants your life.

481
00:24:00,720 --> 00:24:03,480
Men are more jealous than women.

482
00:24:04,799 --> 00:24:05,359
No.

483
00:24:06,039 --> 00:24:07,440
For my safety,

484
00:24:07,759 --> 00:24:09,319
I have to help them.

485
00:24:10,720 --> 00:24:11,480
A wooden man

486
00:24:11,599 --> 00:24:12,480
and a proud woman.

487
00:24:13,039 --> 00:24:14,119
I need to stir things up.

488
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:16,680
But Bai Yanli...

489
00:24:16,960 --> 00:24:17,839
I'll deal with him later.

490
00:24:17,880 --> 00:24:18,640
The medicine is getting cold.

491
00:24:18,799 --> 00:24:19,279
Drink it up.

492
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:26,039
It's too bitter.

493
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:26,920
I don't want it.

494
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:29,200
I'm fine. I don't need it.

495
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:30,079
Look.

496
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:31,200
Look.

497
00:24:46,559 --> 00:24:49,359
You can't see how much Cheng Qi cares about you.

498
00:24:55,599 --> 00:24:56,359
Is it broken?

499
00:25:00,519 --> 00:25:01,720
It's fine.

500
00:25:03,240 --> 00:25:04,559
It's all because of Bai Yanliang.

501
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:06,880
He tried to hurt me several times.

502
00:25:06,960 --> 00:25:07,839
You have to take responsibility for this.

503
00:25:09,079 --> 00:25:10,319
What does it have to do with me?

504
00:25:10,759 --> 00:25:11,880
How does it not concern you?

505
00:25:13,359 --> 00:25:14,440
Bai Yanliang

506
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:16,839
He's seen me as a thorn in his side since he arrived.

507
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:20,039
But now I finally understand.

508
00:25:20,799 --> 00:25:23,279
He has been forcing me to divorce you,

509
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:25,160
and even forcing me to say I like someone else.

510
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:27,279
It must be your uncle who sent him.

511
00:25:29,960 --> 00:25:31,160
Gong Xi and Fa Chai

512
00:25:31,160 --> 00:25:32,599
have also complained to me.

513
00:25:33,079 --> 00:25:33,880
I didn't expect

514
00:25:34,119 --> 00:25:36,279
Su Li still hasn't given up on you.

515
00:25:36,440 --> 00:25:37,119
And...

516
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:39,599
And what?

517
00:25:39,880 --> 00:25:40,960
He likes you.

518
00:25:42,839 --> 00:25:43,920
He likes me?

519
00:25:44,759 --> 00:25:45,799
He's just straightforward

520
00:25:45,799 --> 00:25:46,559
and stubborn.

521
00:25:46,759 --> 00:25:48,200
I barely spoke to him.

522
00:25:48,200 --> 00:25:49,160
How could he like me?

523
00:25:49,480 --> 00:25:51,599
There are plenty of straightforward people.

524
00:25:51,599 --> 00:25:52,799
Have you ever seen someone like him before?

525
00:25:57,759 --> 00:25:58,400
Su Yuejiao,

526
00:25:59,000 --> 00:26:00,000
from now on,

527
00:26:00,440 --> 00:26:01,400
my life is yours.

528
00:26:03,880 --> 00:26:04,400
I'll do it.

529
00:26:05,279 --> 00:26:06,880
You can't go out alone anymore.

530
00:26:11,400 --> 00:26:12,599
It's rare.

531
00:26:13,319 --> 00:26:14,720
Not only hardworking,

532
00:26:14,880 --> 00:26:15,960
but also loyal,

533
00:26:16,079 --> 00:26:16,960
and down-to-earth.

534
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:19,480
What a perfect escort.

535
00:26:23,640 --> 00:26:24,359
Where are you going?

536
00:26:24,400 --> 00:26:25,000
Back to Ning'an.

537
00:26:25,319 --> 00:26:26,400
Or I'll be killed.

538
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:29,119
You quit the contest?

539
00:26:30,039 --> 00:26:30,839
I quit.

540
00:26:31,359 --> 00:26:32,160
I can't even make it to the final

541
00:26:32,200 --> 00:26:33,279
and become disabled.

542
00:26:33,599 --> 00:26:35,759
And this agency has no backing.

543
00:26:37,079 --> 00:26:38,720
Alright, stop acting.

544
00:26:39,039 --> 00:26:40,680
When he comes back, I'll tell him.

545
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:41,480
Really?

546
00:26:42,880 --> 00:26:45,599
Will you stay if he stops beating you?

547
00:26:46,079 --> 00:26:47,960
After all, the escort business is competitive,

548
00:26:48,279 --> 00:26:49,400
with fluctuating business.

549
00:26:49,640 --> 00:26:50,640
Talent is hard to come by.

550
00:26:50,640 --> 00:26:51,279
No.

551
00:26:51,799 --> 00:26:53,000
Su's Escort Agency has me or him.

552
00:26:53,000 --> 00:26:53,799
Not both.

553
00:26:55,599 --> 00:26:56,119
Fine.

554
00:26:57,279 --> 00:26:58,079
Then you drink the medicine,

555
00:26:58,480 --> 00:26:59,200
and I'll agree with you.

556
00:27:00,799 --> 00:27:01,359
Then I'll drink half of it.

557
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:02,559
Fine.

558
00:27:04,000 --> 00:27:04,559
Give it to me.

559
00:27:12,839 --> 00:27:13,359
Brother

560
00:27:13,759 --> 00:27:15,079
You didn't just come out now, did you?

561
00:27:17,759 --> 00:27:18,759
For him,

562
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:21,359
you're actually going to tie up your own brother.

563
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:23,839
I didn't even tie the rope tightly.

564
00:27:25,079 --> 00:27:26,240
With your strength,

565
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:27,680
if you use a bit more strength,

566
00:27:27,680 --> 00:27:28,599
I will...

567
00:27:30,839 --> 00:27:31,640
This is medicine.

568
00:27:44,119 --> 00:27:44,440
Oh my god.

569
00:27:44,880 --> 00:27:46,119
Fortunately, Cheng Qi didn't drink it all just now.

570
00:27:47,359 --> 00:27:48,039
Brother.

571
00:27:52,240 --> 00:27:53,839
You go to Huayue Tower to see Tang Xin every day.

572
00:27:55,079 --> 00:27:55,680
You deserve to die.

573
00:27:56,480 --> 00:27:57,960
It's all a misunderstanding, brother.

574
00:27:58,200 --> 00:27:59,559
I'm going to Yue Lao Pavilion.

575
00:28:00,599 --> 00:28:01,359
You have Jiaojiao,

576
00:28:01,359 --> 00:28:02,240
but you still go to ask for a marriage.

577
00:28:02,799 --> 00:28:03,319
You deserve to die more.

578
00:28:04,119 --> 00:28:05,079
Brother,

579
00:28:05,519 --> 00:28:07,400
Jiaojiao said the escort business is up and down.

580
00:28:07,559 --> 00:28:09,000
I'm looking for Meng Feifei to talk about business.

581
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:10,000
It's all for my wife.

582
00:28:26,759 --> 00:28:28,000
It's all a misunderstanding, bro.

583
00:28:32,079 --> 00:28:33,279
Jiaojiao, what's that medicine?

584
00:28:33,680 --> 00:28:34,960
He's about to faint.

585
00:28:37,960 --> 00:28:39,880
It freaked me out.

586
00:28:40,240 --> 00:28:41,519
I need to help him

587
00:28:41,759 --> 00:28:43,119
catch up with Tang Xin ASAP.

588
00:28:59,000 --> 00:28:59,400
Tell me,

589
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:02,240
did Su Li make you drive away Cheng Qi?

590
00:29:03,079 --> 00:29:03,440
Yes.

591
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:05,440
You admit it.

592
00:29:06,440 --> 00:29:07,880
That's why you came to the Escort Agency?

593
00:29:09,279 --> 00:29:09,880
No.

594
00:29:11,599 --> 00:29:13,759
I said my life is yours.

595
00:29:14,200 --> 00:29:15,240
You can take it back at any time.

596
00:29:33,839 --> 00:29:34,880
This is my mother's.

597
00:29:37,119 --> 00:29:38,200
How did it end up in your hands?

598
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:41,720
My life

599
00:29:42,599 --> 00:29:43,640
was saved by your mother.

600
00:29:48,119 --> 00:29:48,720
Stop!

601
00:29:51,359 --> 00:29:52,160
Stop!

602
00:30:10,079 --> 00:30:10,759
The child

603
00:30:13,119 --> 00:30:13,920
Over there.

604
00:30:15,319 --> 00:30:16,079
Catch him.

605
00:30:16,720 --> 00:30:17,200
Quick.

606
00:30:37,039 --> 00:30:37,839
My child.

607
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:43,480
My child.

608
00:31:13,279 --> 00:31:15,000
She's been hunted because of me.

609
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:16,119
I owe you

610
00:31:16,559 --> 00:31:17,279
my life.

611
00:31:27,680 --> 00:31:28,480
If you want to repay me,

612
00:31:30,599 --> 00:31:31,000
come with me.

613
00:31:57,480 --> 00:31:58,680
My mother saved you

614
00:31:59,440 --> 00:32:00,319
expecting nothing in return.

615
00:32:02,279 --> 00:32:04,480
Otherwise, she would have left a trace.

616
00:32:08,279 --> 00:32:09,400
According to the rules of the escort agency,

617
00:32:09,880 --> 00:32:10,799
you've paid your respects to her,

618
00:32:11,000 --> 00:32:11,640
and that's enough.

619
00:32:12,680 --> 00:32:13,240
You can leave now.

620
00:32:14,519 --> 00:32:15,599
Why do you want me to leave?

621
00:32:18,400 --> 00:32:19,200
You're skilled,

622
00:32:19,599 --> 00:32:20,359
and diligent.

623
00:32:20,920 --> 00:32:22,000
You have the potential to be a good escort.

624
00:32:22,839 --> 00:32:25,440
But in our family, escorts protect, not harm.

625
00:32:26,000 --> 00:32:27,519
especially the weak.

626
00:32:29,880 --> 00:32:30,759
My mother believed that.

627
00:32:31,559 --> 00:32:32,440
So do I.

628
00:32:33,799 --> 00:32:34,680
I don't blame you

629
00:32:34,960 --> 00:32:35,640
for helping Su Li.

630
00:32:36,680 --> 00:32:37,400
But you

631
00:32:38,079 --> 00:32:39,319
shouldn't hurt Cheng Qi.

632
00:32:41,640 --> 00:32:42,519
He will hurt you.

633
00:32:42,880 --> 00:32:43,680
I'll protect you.

634
00:32:52,359 --> 00:32:53,759
My mother told me before she died

635
00:32:54,559 --> 00:32:55,640
in the Su's Escort Agency,

636
00:32:55,960 --> 00:32:56,880
the escort is the top priority.

637
00:32:57,400 --> 00:32:59,799
Besides, we haven't taken any escort for years.

638
00:33:00,640 --> 00:33:01,880
I'll take care of myself.

639
00:33:03,640 --> 00:33:06,079
You should have your own things to do.

640
00:33:09,720 --> 00:33:10,200
Take care.
